ngly prominent technology centre with some of the fastest internet speeds in the world. Romania is a member of several international organisations, including the European Union, NATO, and the BSEC. | Charles V, Holy Roman Emperor: Portrait of Charles V seated on a chair Charles V (24 February 1500 – 21 September 1558) was Holy Roman Emperor from 1519 until his abdication in 1556, as well as King... | 900+ ROMAN ideas | ancient rome, roman, roman empire: Roman Empire Travel Route. Study Ancient Roman Maps. Odysseus Trip Map. Map Of Corsicana.A macellum is an ancient Roman indoor market building that sold mostly provisions.
